<title>USA: Martin Color-Fi Q4 shr profit $0.24.</title>
<headline>Martin Color-Fi Q4 shr profit $0.24.</headline>
<dateline>EDGEFIELD, S.C. 1997-02-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>(In thousands, except per share amounts)</p>
<p>				  Fourth Quarter Ended  Year Ended</p>
<p>				    December 31,     December 31,</p>
<p>				    1996    1995     1996     1995</p>
<p> Net sales		  $  27,690  23,139$ 114,416$ 116,970</p>
<p> Gross profit		   6,304   3,997   22,963   21,705</p>
<p>Income (loss)</p>
<p>   from operations	    3,267    (25)   10,937    9,094</p>
<p> Net income (loss)	    1,572   (618)    4,434    2,956</p>
<p>Net income (loss)</p>
<p>   per share		     0.24  (0.09)     0.67     0.44</p>
<p>Weighted average</p>
<p>   shares outstanding	 6,669   6,657    6,660    6,657</p>
<p>NOTE: Full company name is Martin Color-Fi Inc.</p>
<p>Results for the fourth quarter of 1995 were reduced by an after-tax charge of $777,000, or $0.12 per share, to reflect the estimated costs associated with settlement of a lawsuit by a shareholder alleging violations of federal securities laws and related state laws.  The parties have agreed in principle to enter into a settlement agreement to end the litigation.</p>
<p>--((New York Newsdesk 212 859-1610))</p>
